<title>HONG KONG: NatWest sets warrants on Hong Kong property basket.</title>
<headline>NatWest sets warrants on Hong Kong property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Financial Products Plc said on Tuesday it had issued 239 million American style call warrants on a basket of four blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	     0.05  shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	    0.04  shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	   0.075 shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd    0.02  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.7225   PREMIUM	 11.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2852    GEARING	 4.6x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 20.MAY.97    LISTING DATE  05.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAY.98    PAYDATE	 04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$13.025</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
